<Name id="ref-1056">RIG_MSG_07</Name>
<Description href="#ref-211"/>
<ToolTip href="#ref-211"/>
<Text id="ref-1057">&#34;FOR ENGINE F100 YOU HAVE TO SET THE ABINHIBIT STOP POSITION. (WHEN ABHINIBIT IS ACTIVATED ON HMO SCREEN, SERVO MOTOR WILL STOP TO THAT POSITION)&#34;</Text>
